{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Centerville Middle School chess team consists of two boys and three girls. A photographer wants to take a picture of the team to appear in the local newspaper. She decides to have them sit in a row with a boy at each end and the three girls in the middle. How many such arrangements are possible?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d24e13cb3ffbf5ccb8653b83afe7c1f56b0db030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }5\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }6\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/e/08eed0e2f54bd106261e5f5422a6f5526bfcbfbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2! = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> ways to order the boys on the ends, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3920c5e3f6b2e5749cd75c3853b63ae714d00561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> ways to order the girls in the middle. We get the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b77ee7c1e42ca431ce1254894358003f395d2908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 6 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/srGyMofBMsE\">https://youtu.be/srGyMofBMsE</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Zhsb5lv6jCI\">https://youtu.be/Zhsb5lv6jCI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4sUA1029D14\">https://youtu.be/4sUA1029D14</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <